      "id": "feature_adoption",
      "title": "Feature adoption",
      "narrative": "Acme's engine usage grew across the board this quarter. showNotification led volume at 15,020 uses, up from 14,078. setDiscount followed at 13,261, up from 12,486, and addLoyaltyPoints rose to 5,911 from 5,578. The standout is rejectCoupon, which grew from 3,015 to 4,328 uses, a swing of roughly 44%, moving it from occasional use into a regular part of the flow.\n\nacceptCoupon is the one feature moving the other way, down from 4,909 to 4,183 uses, about a 15% decline. All five capabilities in this review are entitled and active; there is no unused entitlement to flag this quarter. Worth watching whether acceptCoupon's dip and rejectCoupon's rise are two sides of the same shift in how shoppers are responding at checkout.",
