    {
      "id": "relationship_context",
      "title": "Since we last spoke",
      "narrative": "Two of the three actions from the last review are closed. Acme reviewed Winback Reactivation eligibility against margin ahead of the Q2 refresh and narrowed the eligibility window, a commitment now marked done. The account team's commitment to share Basket Boost segment performance so Acme could plan Q3 budget is also done.\n\nOne action remains open: agreeing a points expiry or redemption catalogue so the loyalty balance stops accruing unchecked. This sits with Acme, was raised again on a recent call, and is still unscheduled. Worth putting a date on it this quarter.",
